        <zz:originalDescription>伤寒论第96条：或胁下痞硬……加牡蛎四两。</zz:originalDescription>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">少阳枢机不利。</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

